[!- import "built-in/helpers.neoj" as neo -!]
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
body {
    background-color: #200;
    color: #dfd;
    line-height: 1.3;
}
header, main, footer {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: auto;
}
.bordered {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dfd;
    border-top: 1px solid #dfd;
    padding: 1rem;
}
.built-in-flow > :where(:not(:first-child)) {
  margin-top: var(--flow-space, 1em);
}
.flow > :where(:not(:first-child)) {
  margin-top: var(--flow-space, 1em);
}
pre {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
        <header>
            <a href="/">Home</a>
        </header>
        <main class="built-in-flow flow">
            <h1>Something unexpected happened</h1>
            <p>This page shows up when you try to go to a 
                page that doesn't exist. That's not a big
                deal. It can happen a lot when you're working
                on your site and we can use the info below
                to figure out how to fix it.</p>

            <p>There are two main causes for a page
                not showing up here:
            </p>
            <ol class="built-in-flow flow">
                <li>Something tried to link to a page that really 
                    doesn't exist. If that's the case, the next
                    step is to figure out where the link came from. If
                    you just clicked a link to get to this page then
                    that link is a good place to start. 
                </li>
                <li>A page was supposed to be here, but something
                    happened that prevented it from being output
                    properly. If that's the case, check out the
                    &quot;Issues On Pages&quot; section below
                    to find the source page that should have 
                    output here to figure out what issues
                    are happening with it. 
                </li>
            </ol>

        <h2>Issues On Pages</h2>
            <ul>
        [! for id in site.get_page_ids(site, page) !]
            [! set check_page = site.get_page_with_id(site, page, id) !]
            [! if check_page.issues !]
                <li class="built-in built-in-flow">
                    <details class="built-in built-in-flow"><summary>[@ check_page.source_display_path -@]</summary>
                    <ul class="built-in built-in-flow">
                    [@- neo.debug_page_issues(site, check_page) -@]
                    </ul>
                    </details>
                </li>
            [! endif !]
        [! endfor !]

        [! for display_path in site.get_keys_for_pages_without_ids(site, page) !]
            [! set check_page = site.get_page_with_display_path(site, page, display_path) !]
            [! if check_page.issues !]
                <li class="built-in built-in-flow">
                    <details class="built-in built-in-flow"><summary>[@ check_page.source_display_path -@]</summary>
                    <ul class="built-in built-in-flow">
                    [@- neo.debug_page_issues(site, check_page) -@]
                    </ul>
                    </details>
                </li>
            [! endif !]
        [! endfor !]
            </ul>

[! for template_load_error in template_load_errors !]
[! if loop.first !]
<h3>Problems Loading Templates</h3>
<div class="bordered">
[! endif !]
<div>[@ template_load_error.message @]</div>
                <div><pre>[@ template_load_error.details@]</pre></div>
[! if loop.last!]
</div>
[! endif !]
[! endfor !]



            [#
<h3>Error</h3>
<div class="bordered"><pre>[! autoescape true !][@ '' @][! endautoescape !]</pre></div>
<h3>Source</h3>
<div class="bordered"><pre>[! autoescape true !][@ page.source @][! endautoescape !]</pre></div>
<h3>Raw Data</h3>
<div class="bordered"><pre>[! autoescape true !][@ page.sections|tojson(true) @][! endautoescape !]</pre></div>
<h3>Tree</h3>
<div class="bordered"><pre>[! autoescape true !][@ ast|tojson(true) @][! endautoescape !]</pre></div>
            #]

</main>
        <footer>
        <div>[@ site.generated_at("Generated on %a. %B %-d at %-I:%M:%S%p") @]</div>
        </footer>

</body>
</html>
